        "id": 1,
        "description": "1. The first thing you have to do is **pull the lever to start rotating the world**.\n2. You will only have a single light to show what's nearby.\n3. Next, on the first downward slope, **wait for the ladder to be visible, then jump to it** when it is safe.\n4. Finally there is a wooden box, where you have to **push it to the left, and land on it**, then **walk right** to proceed to the next chapter.",
